{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":100720,\"title\":\"Local Perspective\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Follow Chen Danqing's eyes to gain insight into the subtle and vast world of Wanhua and enjoy the wonderful details of famous paintings. Chen Danqing's eyes are a precious artistic treasure of this era. This program, through his eyes, his words, his insight and aesthetics, tells the story of each minute part of a masterpiece of Chinese and Western painting, a wonderful detail that no one notices but will be enlightened and applauded after seeing it. The whole film was shot in Chen Danqing's studio and later supplemented with a lot of animation effects. Through topics and stories of interest to young people, the film is guided to re-examine the neglected corners of art creation and artists in various periods.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ardYSurlkOyFZCT35cSoEx7CNzQ.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3tMoVDRl6QYm0uffYyrTCmSGadT.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":4,\"year\":2015,\"genres\":[\"Talk\"],\"status\":\"Returning Series\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":3,\"totalEpisodes\":44,\"createdBy\":[\"Chen Danqing\"],\"networks\":[],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"CN\",\"name\":\"China\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2020-04-01\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":2615317,\"name\":\"Mengqian Xie\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rSFvg6Q4voKBfX2iUKYffLpcacy.jpg\"},{\"id\":2615317,\"name\":\"Mengqian Xie\",\"character\":\"导演\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rSFvg6Q4voKBfX2iUKYffLpcacy.jpg\"},{\"id\":1074554,\"name\":\"Chen Danqing\",\"character\":\"主讲\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oEpgXshX9nsiG0Y875MUnV4mpjd.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"CGd9GTmE3Hc\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"3Y6IJ5me4O4\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\